    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305-a3">

                <pb facs="0664" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg580"/>

                <head>A.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">To-Day</hi>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1886-01-11">11 <hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi>, 1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I, Santaña Perez, say that unexpectedly we have met the American troops and a
                    party of Indian soldiers on the Rio Haros, and that we Mexicans fired only three
                    volleys before either party ascertained our mistake.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Señor Captain</hi> CRAWFORD.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Señor Lieutenant</hi> MAUS.</item>
                            <item>SANTAÑA PEREZ.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
